# evidence. The body is wrapped now; `checker_completed` is recorded ONLY on the crash path, so a
# completing run is byte-identical and readings 3-6 stay reproducible -- it can turn a missing
# verdict into a failing one and never a failure into a pass. All six checker fixtures produce
